test-results/

# Node build residue at paths this repository no longer tracks.
#
# mx-lab/ and reach-app/ carry their own .gitignore. masterclip-os/ used to as
# well, and that file was deleted along with the vendored tree when the product
# moved to its own repository — which left the path uncovered rather than gone.
# A fresh clone never has the directory, but an existing working copy still
# holds whatever was built there: node_modules, dist, and a local .env that is
# no longer ignored by anything. Same story for demo-video/, whose own
# ignore rules left with the pull request that proposed it.
#
# Neither path should ever be tracked here again. Ignoring them keeps a stale
# checkout one `git add -A` further away from committing a gigabyte of
# dependencies, rendered video, or a developer's environment file.
/masterclip-os/
/demo-video/
